& [ConstructiveHemisphere]
  + one signed commission bridges the published inert plan to a real scratch build without turning plan text into ambient authority
  + exact operation receipts make toolchain discovery extraction and every Cargo gate visible to later audit

& [AdversarialHemisphere]
  + archive traversal links root collision command or environment mutation can escape the declared work surface
  + missing dependency toolchain disk output or time capacity can invite an unauthorized install download retry or relabeled success
  + cleanup repeat execution or retained process state can silently extend a one-run grant

& [Synthesis]
  + retain canonical closed shapes exact digests link-free bounded extraction reviewed argv arrays fixed environment stop-on-first-failure and no automatic cleanup
  + independent receipt reconstruction and protected/provider conservation decide the claim; later recurring execution remains a new contract
